{"title":"빌어먹을 환생","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=c5Rq1b/hzXaqmhccR/mB9PrcxIwFngfzK4TqXvc1&filename=th3","synopsis":"마왕을 없애기 위해 용사와 함께 모험을 하던 하멜. \n마왕과의 대결 직전 용사 베르무트 라이언하트를 구하고 대신 죽음을 맞이하게 된다. \n\n그리고 300년 후. \n\n하멜은 용사의 머나먼 후손인 유진 라이언하트로서 환생한다. \n죽기 전의 육체보다 월등한 성능을 가진 천재로서. \n\n전생의 경험을 토대로 더 뛰어난 육체에 맞춰 폭발적인 성장을 하는 유진. \n전생에 이루지 못한 마왕 토벌을 위해 유진은 쉼없이 자신을 단련하며 이루지 못했던 목표를 향해 다시 나아간다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":135,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":103,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":131,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":161,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":156,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":112,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":128,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":133,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":104,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":121,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":106,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":111,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":120,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":121,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":130,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":134